{"language":"kr","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","舰炮轰击"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/kr","캐논 파이어"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对敌方英雄发射火炮，造成范围伤害。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/kr","적 영웅에게 대포를 발사해 광역 대미지를 입힌다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","依次对所有敌方英雄发射1枚火炮，至少发射5枚火炮，火炮对1格范围内的敌人造成320% + 30% ATK伤害，对1格范围的友军造成100% ATK伤害，同一个角色重复受到2次以上的火炮伤害降低为20%。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","모든 적 영웅에게 차례대로 대포 1발을 발사하고, 최소 5발을 발사할 수 있다. 대포는 1칸 범위 내 적에게는 320% + 30% ATK의 대미지를 입히고, 1칸 범위 내 아군에게는 100% ATK의 대미지를 입힌다. 같은 유닛이 대포 대미지를 2회 이상 받을 경우 대미지가 20%로 감소한다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":42,"end":48,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":66,"end":72,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":38,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":65,"end":73,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":62,"end":76,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":102,"end":110,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","火炮对敌人造成的伤害提升至330% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대포로 적에게 입히는 대미지가 330% + 30% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","火炮对敌人造成的伤害提升至340% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","대포로 적에게 입히는 대미지가 340% + 30% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","火炮对敌人造成的伤害提升至350% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","대포로 적에게 입히는 대미지가 350% + 30% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","火炮对敌人造成的伤害提升至360% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/kr","대포로 적에게 입히는 대미지가 360% + 30% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","复能灵御"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/kr","영혼의 중단"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","进入灵体状态，免疫物理伤害并回复生命。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/kr","영체 상태가 되어 물리 대미지에 면역되고 HP를 회복한다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","使得自身进入8 + 0.5秒灵体状态，免疫所有物理伤害，期间每秒回复-70% − 10% ATK的生命值。被动地，释放终极技能时，立即使自身进入4秒灵体形态。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","8 + 0.5초 동안 영체 상태가 되어 모든 물리 대미지에 면역되며, 초당 -70% − 10% ATK의 HP를 회복한다. \n패시브: 궁극기 시전 시 즉시 4초 동안 영체 상태에 진입한다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":13,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":38,"end":44,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":1,"end":7,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":46,"end":52,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":42,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","灵体状态下每秒回复的生命值提升至-80% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","영체 상태에서 초당 회복되는 HP가 -80% − 10% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","灵体状态下每秒回复的生命值提升至-90% − 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","영체 상태에서 초당 회복되는 HP가 -90% − 10% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":26,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":20,"end"